{"id": "70294", "title": "秦景记", "author": "玖月晞", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 26, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70294/70294s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70294.htm", "intro": "智商极高的逻辑学家言溯(严肃)什么都懂，唯独不懂情商；\r\n    智商偏高的生物学家甄爱(真爱)什么都好，唯独爱出神，其实就是反应慢；\r\n    当她没反应的时候，\r\n    言溯：你的神经反射弧可以绕地球五圈。\r\n    当她有反应的时候，\r\n    甄爱：觉得冷。\r\n    言溯：那是因为肾阳虚；还可能是血液缺铁，甲状腺素分泌不足......\r\n    甄爱：谢谢！\r\n    当他相信她的时候，\r\n    言溯：当然不会是你杀的人；要是你杀人，一定会用一种更狠毒却不失优雅的方式。\r\n    甄爱：谢谢！\r\n    当他不相信她的时候，他要以严肃的方式扑倒真爱......\r\n    其实，这是一篇有言溯有甄爱的言情+推理文。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70294", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "chapter 1", "file": "10921342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 2", "file": "10921343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 3", "file": "10921344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 4", "file": "10921345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 5", "file": "10921346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 6", "file": "10921347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 7", "file": "10921348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 8", "file": "10921349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 9", "file": "10921350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 10", "file": "10921351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 11", "file": "10921352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 12", "file": "10921353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 13", "file": "10921354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 14", "file": "10921355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 15", "file": "10921356.html", "available": true}, {"title": "chapter 16", "file": "10921357.html", "available": true}, {"title": "chapter 17", "file": "10921358.html", "available": true}, {"title": "chapter 18", "file": "10921359.html", "available": true}, {"title": "chapter 19", "file": "10921360.html", "available": true}, {"title": "chapter 20", "file": 